      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Read the notes",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>No corridor to this target</strong> and <strong>Caution</strong> are notes. <strong>Send</strong> still works.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/11a07a82a571bb2d.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See a drone fall short",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>Change</strong>, pick a drone and tap <strong>Update plan</strong>. One that falls short is still planned, and <strong>Range</strong> says <strong>Too far</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/10e831876cd6c664.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Check before sending",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When the plan has a problem, <strong>Send</strong> lists it first. <strong>Change plan</strong> opens the drone and window choices again, and <strong>Send anyway</strong> sends it as it is.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/34792bdf730da2a7.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Fix it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Pick a drone that reaches, and a later <strong>To</strong> time if it must fly longer. When <strong>Range</strong> says <strong>Ok</strong>, tap <strong>Send</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/60ace34816819693.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Another mission in the way",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Another team planning near your route at the same time sees your mission, here <strong>Overlaps Recon 4</strong>. When you see <strong>Overlaps</strong>, check with that team before you tap <strong>Send anyway</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/57e9f65fbfe3cb73.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
